":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106539\r\nPartially fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103771\r\nPartially fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/76215\r\n\r\nIt seems that setting the text manually does not trigger `text_changed` and this is by design. However for the web and when using a virtual keyboard we are emulating a text change. This PR makes sure `text_changed` signal is triggered after setting the text.\r\n\r\nAnother alternative is to introduce a `text_set` signal [similarly to TextEdit](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/gui/text_edit.cpp#L3983) (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/50372).","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}]